# API & integrations

- Validate input; return JSON errors without leaking stack traces.
- Stripe webhooks: verify signature with `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET`.
- Contact: requires `RESEND_API_KEY`; safe fallback messaging if unset.
- Server-only secrets: never prefix tutor Calendly or Stripe secret with `NEXT_PUBLIC_`.
- Document new env vars in `.env.example` and `memory-bank/techContext.md`.
